---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const updated = 'August 31, 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | ManhwaDaily"
  description="Privacy policy for ManhwaDaily, including analytics, affiliate tracking, advertising, and the AI Portrait paid feature."
  slug="privacy"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="border-b border-brand-border/50 py-14">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <p class="text-brand-coral text-sm font-semibold mb-3">ManhwaDaily</p>
        <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-brand-white mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-dim leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: {updated}
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy applies to <strong>ManhwaDaily</strong> (the &quot;Service&quot;),
          accessible at <a href="https://manhwadaily.com">manhwadaily.com</a>. ManhwaDaily
          publishes manhwa and light novel recommendations, rankings, a recommendation quiz,
          a free browser game (Gate Crawler / Gate Crawler World), and a paid AI Portrait
          feature. This Privacy Policy explains what information we may collect, how we use it,
          and how third-party providers may process information when you visit the site,
          play the game, use the recommendation quiz, or purchase an AI Portrait.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We may collect website usage information such as pages viewed, referral sources,
          approximate geographic region, browser type, device type, and interaction metrics.
          If you create an account, we collect the email address and profile information you
          provide through our authentication provider (Clerk). If you play Gate Crawler World
          and sign in, your character progress and best score are stored against your account.
        </p>

        <h2>AI Portrait — Your Photo</h2>
        <p>
          If you use the AI Portrait tool, the photo you upload is sent to our image-generation
          provider solely to produce your stylized portrait preview and, if you complete
          payment, the final print-ready file. We do not use your photo for any purpose beyond
          generating that portrait, and we do not knowingly retain uploaded photos longer than
          needed to complete your order.
        </p>

        <h2>Payments</h2>
        <p>
          Payment for the AI Portrait is processed by PayPal. We do not receive or store your
          full payment card details — PayPal handles that directly. We retain a record of the
          order (product, order ID, amount, and payer email if provided by PayPal) to fulfill
          purchases and handle support requests.
        </p>

        <h2>Accounts</h2>
        <p>
          Account sign-in is provided by Clerk. If you create an account, Clerk processes your
          email address and authentication data according to its own privacy policy. We use
          your account only to save your Gate Crawler World progress, your bookmarked "My List"
          entries, and (if you choose to appear there) your Gate Crawler World leaderboard entry.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We may use analytics services, including Google Analytics, to measure aggregate
          website traffic and user behavior. These services may use cookies or similar
          technologies according to their own policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate Links and Attribution</h2>
        <p>
          Some links on ManhwaDaily are affiliate links, including links to Amazon and to
          manhwa/novel reading platforms such as Webtoon, Tapas, and MangaDex. If you click an
          affiliate link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no
          additional cost to you.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We may display advertisements through third-party advertising providers, including
          Google AdSense or similar networks. Advertising providers may use cookies or related
          technologies to deliver, limit, or measure ads according to their own policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Comments</h2>
        <p>
          Article comments are powered by Giscus, which stores comments as GitHub Discussions
          on our public site repository. To comment, you sign in with your own GitHub account
          directly through Giscus/GitHub — we do not receive or store your GitHub credentials.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website and third-party services may use cookies, pixels, or similar technologies
          for analytics, affiliate attribution, security, and functionality. Some preferences
          (such as your Gate Crawler World save, daily streak, and theme) are stored in your
          browser's local storage rather than a cookie.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell personal information. We may share limited information with service
          providers that help operate analytics, authentication (Clerk), payments (PayPal),
          image generation, and hosting.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can disable cookies in your browser, delete your account through Clerk, or avoid
          submitting personal information through forms. Some website features may not work as
          expected if cookies or local storage are disabled.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information, but no
          online system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to request access, correction, or
          deletion of personal information we hold about you. To make such a request, contact us
          through the official website or public brand channels.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy as the site or services change. The latest version
          will be posted on this page.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions, data requests, or policy concerns, contact ManhwaDaily through
          the website or the official ManhwaDaily public channels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
